
calculate_values
CalculateRate5PL
#Calculation of change in reaction degree 
-mybasic
-start
'[
Parameters:
1   A minimum (typically 0%)
2   B steepness
3   C time of infection point (days)
4   D maximum (% - linked to reactivity)
5   G assymetry 
6   time (totaltime) 
']
    change = 1 + (calc_arg(6)/calc_arg(3))^calc_arg(2)
    change = (calc_arg(1)-calc_arg(4))/change
    change = change^calc_arg(5)
    change = calc_arg(D) + change
    save(change)
-end
